  "methodology": {
    "margin": "Democratic minus Republican votes, divided by all votes for listed candidates, in percentage points. Other includes every other listed candidate. Write-ins are not separately reported in the statewide candidate files.",
    "change": "2024 Democratic-minus-Republican margin minus the 2020 margin; positive means toward Democratic candidates.",
    "turnout": "Ballots cast divided by registered voters, calculated from official counts. Ballots cast includes ballots without a vote for the office; it is not the candidate vote total.",
    "house": "County totals combine all House districts within each county by candidate party. This is a county party vote comparison, not a district result, seat winner or comparison of unchanged districts. Congressional boundaries changed between these elections.",
    "reconciliation": "All candidate county sums match the official candidate totals. Turnout county sums match statewide registered-voter and ballots-cast totals in both years. No mismatches found."
